"(TITLE) - A Web-Based Coffin Sales System for Enhancing Funeral Service"

Introduction 

    In the modern digital era, web-based systems play a vital role in improving the efficiency and accessibility
of business operations. Funeral service providers, which offer essential services during sensitive and emotional
times, often rely on traditional and manual methods for managing product sales, customer information, 
and transactions. These manual processes can result in delays, errors, and difficulties in maintaining organized records,
especially when quick and accurate service is required.

The Web-based Coffin sales system for enhancing funeral service is developed to address these challenges by provinding an organized, secure, and user-friendly online platform for managing coffin sales and services.
The system allows funeral service providers to digitally manage product listings, customer details, and sales transactions through a centralized web interface. One of the core components of the system is a secure login and registration module, which ensures that only authorized users can access and manage system functionalities.

The implemented login form enables users to sign in using their registered email and password, while the registration feature allows new users to create an account by providing essential personal details. The system also includes user-friendly features such as password visibility toggling and options for social media login, enhancing usability and convenience. By integrating authentication mechanisms, the system helps protect sensitive information and maintains data integrity within the platform.

